    "q-48948": {
      "dom_id": "step-q48948",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14259483/assets/a074e2931c35862d5611cd3b2efe285144c7f85ce62b88278ee79851c8e40bf4.png)\n\nGiven the plots of $y=f(x)$ and $y=g(x)$ above, find ${h}^{′}(4)$ where $h(x)=\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}.$",
      "worked_solution": "The quotient rule for derivatives gives\n\n$$\n{h}^{′}(x)=\\frac{{f}^{′}(x)\\cdot g(x)-f(x)\\cdot {g}^{′}(x)}{(g(x))^{2}}.\n$$\n\nAs a result, we have that\n\n$$\n{h}^{′}(4)=\\frac{{f}^{′}(4)\\cdot g(4)-f(4)\\cdot {g}^{′}(4)}{(g(4))^{2}}.\n$$\n\nFrom the graph above, we obtain that $f(4)=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $g(4)=-\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\nAdditionally:\n\n- The slope of $f(x)$ on $x\\in (3,5)$ equals $-\\frac{3}{2}.$ So, ${f}^{′}(4)=-\\frac{3}{2}.$\n\n- The slope of $g(x)$ on $x\\in (\\frac{7}{2},5)$ equals $1.$ So, ${g}^{′}(4)=1.$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(4) & =\\frac{{f}^{′}(4)\\cdot g(4)-f(4)\\cdot {g}^{′}(4)}{{(g(4))}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-\\frac{3}{2})\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 1}{{(-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\frac{1}{4})}{(\\frac{1}{4})} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-48948-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{4}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"29\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-48948-b",
